       }
      ],
      "text": "W.in its age range (↔):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " hearing (●); dyslipidemia (●); HIV (●); hepatitis B (★ risk assessment); hepatitis C (●); sudden ♡ arrest/death (★ risk assessment)."
     }
